[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_07]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_07_desc]
Cloudsdale’s weather factory controls the snowfall time every year, but sometimes there are some small problems, such as Derpy Hooves ordering muffins to fall this year instead of snow.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_07_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about weather factory, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_07]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_07_desc]
云中城的天气工厂控制着每年的下雪时间，不过有时候会出现一些小问题，比如说，呆蹄命令今年应该下马芬而不是下雪。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_07_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于天气工厂的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

